{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t受強颱風薔琵影響，大灣區航空今明兩日有兩班來往香港及台北的航班需要調整。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n兩個航班包括由香港往台北的HB710航班，原定今晚出發，最新出發時間為明早6時許；由台北往香港的HB711航班，原本明日凌晨出發，最新出發時間為明早9時。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:40.506173+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:52:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T20:58:50.455627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:39:04.143713+00:00","content_hash":"9e5fef74ee3c5f6cd7a404b43bda170b2d7c95cd142526798f4c4ecb847594ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}